This directory groups the custom pre- and post-processing libraries that the
DS3D inference filters load through nvdsinferserver. Each subdirectory builds
one shared library and has its own README:

    ds3d_lidar_detection_postprocess/
        libnvds_3d_infer_postprocess_lidar_detection.so — parses LiDAR object
        detection output tensors into ds3d 3D bounding boxes.

    ds3d_v2x_infer_custom_preprocess/
        libnvds_3d_v2x_infer_custom_preprocess.so — voxelization, pillar
        scatter and BEV pooling for the V2X fusion model.

    ds3d_v2x_infer_custom_postprocess/
        libnvds_3d_v2x_infer_custom_postprocess.so — decodes the V2X fusion
        model output into ds3d 3D bounding boxes.

This Makefile is an aggregator only; it forwards `all`, `install` and `clean`
to each subdirectory.

More details, refer to the DeepStream SDK documentation for section of "DeepStream 3D Custom Manual".
https://docs.nvidia.com/metropolis/deepstream/dev-guide/text/DS_3D_Custom_Manual.html

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Pre-requisites:
- libnvds_3d_common.so (build and install ds3d/common first)
- libyaml-cpp Development package
- CUDA Runtime and nvcc

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Compiling and installing these libs:
- Export CUDA_VER, then build. sudo -E keeps the variable for make.
  $ export CUDA_VER=13.2 # x86, Jetson and SBSA. For IGX Thor, CUDA_VER=13.0
  $ make && sudo -E make install

NOTE: Compiling does not need root. Install with `sudo -E` so CUDA_VER is kept. Skip sudo when already root (for example inside a container).
